  "FriendlyName": "OK PhysX Secondary Dynamics",
  "Description": "Drives Koikatsu DynamicBone chains (hair, breasts, skirts, accessories) with PhysX 5.11 rigid bodies, spring drives and distance joints instead of the built-in Verlet solver.",
